        'A considered layer for the daily rotation. The loose unisex cut, dropped shoulders and V-neck keep the shape relaxed; the button front lets you wear it open over a tee or closed as a sweatshirt alternative.',
        'The fabric is 56.44% cotton and 43.56% polyester, weighing 450 gsm (13.3 oz/yd²), with a short-loop fleece interior. This is a sweat cardigan, not a wool knit. Small differences in color and finish can occur between batches.',
        'The gallery includes both colorways, model fit references and close-ups of the neckline, cuffs, buttons and fabric. TapStitch lists the model at 188 cm / 6 ft 2 in, 65 kg / 143 lb, wearing 2XL. Compare garment measurements with a layer you own before choosing a size.',
      ],
      specs: [
        ['Fabric', '56.44% cotton, 43.56% polyester. 450 gsm (13.3 oz/yd²). Short-loop fleece interior.'],
        ['Fit', 'Loose unisex cut with drop shoulders. S–2XL.'],
        ['Construction', 'V-neck, button-front closure and long sleeves.'],
